  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "The denominator of an algebraic fraction must contain a variable. The denominator \\(\\pi\\) in \\((a+b)/\\pi\\) is a constant, and \\(x/2+1\\) and \\(5x^2\\) are both polynomial expressions. Only the denominator of \\(3/(m-1)\\) contains the variable \\(m\\).",
